### 10f. Lessons
- Parallel agents work well on the same file as long as each is scoped to a distinct function.
- Deferring one small step (URL normalization in add_single_video) to an inline pass after parallel agents was the right call to avoid lock-wrap collision.
- Owls review + parallel-agent followup is a powerful two-skill combo — owls surfaces issues Claude-alone misses, parallel agents tackle them concurrently. Worth reaching for on any non-trivial commit.

## 11. [2026-04-18] Private-video skip + smoke test + repo hygiene + RED-phase validation

